1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,600
(Leonard:)I don't want to listen
to music, Sheldon.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:06,220
(Sheldon-bot:)Very well.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,110
(Sheldon-bot:)I don't understand
why you're not enjoying this.

4
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:14,640
(Sheldon-bot:)Together, in this car,
with my enhanced capabilities,

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:17,150
we're like Knight Rider.

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:20,980
Except in Knight Rider, the car
isn't a yammering sphincter.

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,940
(Sheldon-bot:)You mock the sphincter,

8
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,710
(Sheldon-bot:)but the sphincter
is a class of muscle

9
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:29,160
(Sheldon-bot:)without which human beings
couldn't survive.

10
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,500
(Sheldon-bot:)There are over 50
different sphincters

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,170
(Sheldon-bot:)in the human body.

12
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:38,550
(Sheldon-bot:)How many can you name?

13
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:42,450
I was wrong-- this is exactly
like Knight Rider.

14
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,590
(Sheldon-bot:)Perhaps you'd be interested
in a different game.

15
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,060
(Sheldon:)No.

16
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,640
(Sheldon-bot:)This is a photograph of the 1911

17
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:52,060
(Sheldon-bot:)Solvay Conference on the theory
of radiation and quanta.

